      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A giant coronary aneurysm arising from the sinus node artery is reported. Diagnosis of this lesion by computed tomography and angiography is illustrated. The operative management is described. \"Off-pump\" aneurysmectomy was successfully performed. The role of occlusion test of the aneurysm inflow tract is emphasized."},
